  lines:
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9206739d0fdeb04a93e48371b1f0a65, type: 3}
    text: Oh.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9206739d0fdeb04a93e48371b1f0a65, type: 3}
    text: ......
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e9c5a0877fc8e8f48bb667414b72327b, type: 3}
    text: So he still talks about Grandpa.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f9206739d0fdeb04a93e48371b1f0a65, type: 3}
    text: "That\u2019s\u2026 nice"
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: I...
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: I miss him too.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: We had a fight before.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: It was kind of dumb, honestly.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: I got mad, he got mad, and then we just stopped talking.
  - speakerName: Chicken
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917f271717e1f3a4aba68da5138d20ca, type: 3}
    text: "But\u2026 yeah. I still miss him."
